## PHASE 4 — Creator Tools + Editor Integration

**Goal:**
Move from “interesting AI demo” into “real tool editors rely on”.

### Scope

1. Export formats (JSON, CSV, EDL/XML)
2. Basic collab support (shared batches)
3. Global search across clips

### Backend

* `apps/api/internal/http/handlers/storylines.go`
  Add export endpoints:

  * `GET /storylines/{id}/export?format=json|csv|edl|xml`

* `apps/api/internal/services/storyline_service.go`
  Implement export formatting.

* `apps/api/internal/models/user.go` + migrations
  Add ownership, teams, shared access.

* `apps/api/internal/http/handlers/users.go`
  Manage team/permissions.

### AI Worker

Minimal changes; mostly backend format generation.

### Frontend

* `apps/web/src/components/storylines/ExportPanel.tsx`
  UI to choose export format.

* `apps/web/src/components/layout/UserMenu.tsx`
  Show team, workspace, etc.

* `apps/web/src/features/clips/useClipSearch.ts`
  Expanded to global search.

* `apps/web/src/app/(dashboard)/page.tsx`
  Add global search bar.

