## PHASE 5 — Multimodal & Rust Acceleration

**Goal:**
Handle heavier workloads and multimodal comprehension.

### New directory (Rust service)

You may add:

```text
apps/
  video_engine/                      # Rust-based video processing microservice
    src/
      main.rs                        # Server entry
      ffmpeg_adapter.rs              # Fast video/audio operations
      scene_detection.rs             # Scene boundaries
      metrics.rs                     # Telemetry
    Cargo.toml
    Dockerfile
```

### Worker integration

* `apps/ai_worker/clipsense_worker/utils/video.py`
  Calls the Rust service via HTTP/gRPC instead of raw FFmpeg in Python.

* `apps/ai_worker/clipsense_worker/story_engine`
  Incorporate scene boundaries and visual cues into arc modeling.

### Backend / Infra

* `infra/docker/video_engine.Dockerfile`

* `infra/docker/docker-compose.dev.yml`
  Add video_engine service.

* `infra/k8s/...`
  Add deployment and service definitions.

